---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
needsGallery: false
---
<div class="hero-full">
  {% for category in categories %}
    {% categoryDoor category %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="intro-cols">
  <p>Photography grew naturally out of my passion for nature, bird watching and a fascination for optical microscopy and imaging techniques. On this website I collect the photos of landscapes, birds, and smaller lifeforms observed through the microscope I have taken over the years. The collection helps me memorize the places I've visited and track how my photography evolves. Hopefully it also passes along a bit of enthusiasm for nature and bird watching to whoever browses this website.</p>

  <p>I'm drawn to the technical side of photography - working with the available light and mastering camera controls and autofocus for optimal sharpness. I can really lose myself in camera and lens specifications, photography tutorials or tinkering with my microscope. Online there are are some excellent knowledge databases available to fully dive into the technicalities of photography. In my blogs I will share the insights, platforms and tools that I have greatly benefitted from while expanding this hobby.</p>
</div>

<div class="bstrip">
  <div class="bs-head">
    <h2>From the blog</h2>
    <a class="more" href="/blog/">all posts →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="bs-grid">
    {% for post in collections.postsByDate %}
      {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
      <a class="post" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <div class="pd-row">
          <div class="pd">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</div>
          {% for tag in post.data.tags %}{% if tag != "post" %}<span class="tag-pill" data-tag="{{ tag | lower }}">{{ tag }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% if collections.postsByDate.length == 0 %}
      <p class="page-description">No posts yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
